    "message": "fix(connect-four): keep 48dp controls aligned through real scrolling\n\nShare board/control geometry and scroll offset, adapt board height for short\nlandscape views and retain a scrollable portrait layout for large text.\nPreserve all game rules, native sessions, save logic and reviewed Native pin.\n\nMake existing flow/visual tests wait for the actual MissingPlugin fallback;\nretain their game/reward and strict alignment assertions. Add real two-way\nswipe, exposed target and exact manual-piece checks on four small layouts.\nRun the concrete regressions early without weakening any existing gate.\n\nDart source parser and 8 workflow contracts passed locally. Corrected Flutter\nexecution remains pending CI after local runtime/cache recovery failure.",
